#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiopreviewinspector.rst:23 321439a40f2f4db7b0ec015df33d38e1
msgid ""
"FmodAudioPreviewInspector is an editor plugin that enhances the inspector interface for "
":ref:`FmodAudioStream<class_FmodAudioStream>` resources. It adds a visual waveform preview and "
"playback controls directly in the inspector panel."
msgstr ""
"FmodAudioPreviewInspector 在    :ref:`FmodAudioStream<class_FmodAudioStream>`    "
"的检查器面板中添加波形预览和播放控件。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiopreviewinspector.rst:25 6d57401038824b4faeefefe576e583ad
msgid ""
"This allows developers to preview audio assets without needing to play them in-game or use "
"external tools."
msgstr "可直接预览音频资源，无需运行游戏。"
